<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian election count at 0652 GMT.</title>
<headline>Indonesian election count at 0652 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the Indonesian election figures with 100,530,958 ballots of a potential 125 million counted by 1:52 p.m. (0652 GMT) on Friday:</p>
<p>Ruling Golkar party:		  73,999,938 votes, 73.61 pct</p>
<p>United Development Party (PPP):   23,596,086 votes, 23.47 pct</p>
<p>Indonesian Democratic Party (PDI:  2,934,934 votes, 2.92 pct.</p>
<p>In Jakarta of votes counted:</p>
<p>Golkar: 56.9 pct</p>
<p>PPP:    41.1 pct</p>
<p>PDI:     2.0 pct</p>
</text>
